{"page":465,"width":1511,"height":1975,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"제1장","words":[{"text":"제1장","x":1141,"y":207,"width":192,"height":86}]},{"text":"SQL 수행 구조","words":[{"text":"SQL","x":185,"y":408,"width":158,"height":84},{"text":"수행","x":387,"y":403,"width":136,"height":80},{"text":"구조","x":568,"y":407,"width":134,"height":76}]},{"text":"장 소개","words":[{"text":"장","x":198,"y":625,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"소개","x":239,"y":625,"width":52,"height":28}]},{"text":"데이터베이스 성능 고도화 작업이 DBA 임무라고 생각하기 쉽지만, 실제로는 애플리케이션 개발자의 역할이","words":[{"text":"데이터베이스","x":211,"y":704,"width":145,"height":27},{"text":"성능","x":367,"y":704,"width":46,"height":27},{"text":"고도화","x":424,"y":704,"width":68,"height":27},{"text":"작업이","x":502,"y":704,"width":63,"height":27},{"text":"DBA","x":578,"y":707,"width":48,"height":22},{"text":"임무라고","x":637,"y":704,"width":87,"height":27},{"text":"생각하기","x":735,"y":702,"width":85,"height":28},{"text":"쉽지만,","x":834,"y":703,"width":73,"height":31},{"text":"실제로는","x":922,"y":704,"width":90,"height":27},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":1022,"y":704,"width":136,"height":27},{"text":"개발자의","x":1171,"y":703,"width":90,"height":27},{"text":"역할이","x":1275,"y":702,"width":67,"height":28}]},{"text":"더 중요하다. 데이터베이스 성능을 결정짓는 가장 핵심적인 요소는 모두 애플리케이션에 집중돼 있기 때문이다.","words":[{"text":"더","x":178,"y":747,"width":22,"height":27},{"text":"중요하다.","x":212,"y":747,"width":106,"height":28},{"text":"데이터베이스","x":332,"y":747,"width":139,"height":28},{"text":"성능을","x":481,"y":748,"width":66,"height":27},{"text":"결정짓는","x":557,"y":747,"width":86,"height":28},{"text":"가장","x":652,"y":747,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"핵심적인","x":706,"y":746,"width":87,"height":28},{"text":"요소는","x":804,"y":748,"width":68,"height":25},{"text":"모두","x":882,"y":749,"width":46,"height":26},{"text":"애플리케이션에","x":937,"y":747,"width":161,"height":28},{"text":"집중돼","x":1110,"y":746,"width":66,"height":29},{"text":"있기","x":1188,"y":746,"width":44,"height":28},{"text":"때문이다.","x":1245,"y":746,"width":99,"height